{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fd7f07c0ef13ad309510aae88ddf67a19ae06f1eb8cece70583b2f30627f9130", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nパジャマ姿の未来は、どこかウキウキしてる）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n穿着睡衣的未来，看起来有些兴奋。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "ff537dd4b800abc878d51aa3da58794881fb70ee6b4c890b9387073360dd5be7", "ja": "えへへ♪　こういうパジャマを着てると、\nなんだか大人の仲間入りって感じですね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 穿着这样的睡衣，总觉得自己好像也成了大人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a9ec5941d40c5addcbc2f3c09a9df1c32bd9bb49f69e7b838c3d9ff1b0e3b17f", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。\n心なしか、いつもより大人びてるような気がするよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。\n总觉得你比平时更有大人风范了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "9bd9b6ad87049b68b7d7136a6140cb11ddb37eef90a47c9fbb583a0bd7a7b28e", "ja": "{$P$}さんもそう思いますか！？\nじゃあ、今日の撮影は大人っぽく頑張りまーす！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也这么觉得吗！？\n那今天的拍摄，我可要表现得成熟一点啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "04e0e1c912ebdb64466dbca6e4d3094e6a6f33c847d6a8c74755f52706984151", "ja": "私、今日のために勉強してきたんですよ。\n大人について、いーっぱい！", "zh": "我为了今天可是做了不少功课呢。\n关于大人的事，学了好多好多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1005_p", "source_sha256": "adf34b4b1eca7b261877f011eaa95fa86b932d84cf4dd375005a29fb166cd708", "ja": "……大人の、勉強？", "zh": "……关于大人的，学习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "87762e99a7d770676361b51fd358d86c84df9555a036069973ea632ddd4c58d3", "ja": "はい！　お母さんのことを観察したり、\n漫画やドラマをみてみたり……。", "zh": "是的！观察妈妈，或者看看漫画和电视剧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "8854bbe34e57bdb2f6106c6a8b9558c43e1ea552aa0b84b86b595d9016fbf9b8", "ja": "百合子に聞いたら、なんか難しいこと言ってて、\nこのみさんは「そのままでも十分セクシーよ」って。", "zh": "我去问了百合子，她说了些挺难懂的话，\n而好美姐则说：“保持原样就已经足够性感了。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e03a05b67e4127a2dec566a0dbcf2a41f10c30bb405e050d55d10e62106e833f", "ja": "な、なるほど。\n未来なりに、大人を学んできたんだな。", "zh": "原、原来如此。\n未来也用自己的方式学习过如何成为大人了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "32426f7207becb3065f590986ad35615c0c8dfb0e227919487b4d0ed4de9d648", "ja": "そうなんです！　まずは……あ、そうだ。\nウィンクしながら投げキッスとかいいかも！", "zh": "就是这样！首先……啊，对了。\n一边眨眼一边飞吻之类的，或许不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b18f99925017111bfe64e75ad50f3da9c96f918b6047dcdea3bf879dd8254dcb", "ja": "ちょっと待った、未来！\nそれは誰に教えてもらったんだ？", "zh": "等等，未来！\n那是谁教你的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "76fb2218a44e8be242e473f0a58487cc7768c59efccf1b314776cbca26cf2998", "ja": "？　莉緒さんですよ？　初級のセクシーだから\n私にピッタリだって言ってました。", "zh": "？　莉绪教我的呀？她说这是初级的性感，正适合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5ac2c7a82fccb1eec10df84359270a22252bece5ab4cb6b5f470a97054446874", "ja": "そ、そうか……。まあ、莉緒の教えは程々にして、\n未来らしい大人っぽさを表現してみよう！", "zh": "这、这样啊……总之，莉绪教的那些就适可而止，试着展现出属于未来的成熟感吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "cb641a0974700ba3c45a3caeb9b31d663b4ffbf791a4a628514047b0d71b2eef", "ja": "わかりました！　ファンの人たちがびっくりするような\n大人の春日未来を見せちゃいます♪", "zh": "我明白了！我会让粉丝们大吃一惊，\n展现出成熟大人的春日未来给他们看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0493_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "c87bd2a67f5dfb1192c4dc3aba0a60af00ed30bd3f71a6d7d252849f85b22cd8", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\n私から目を離しちゃダメですよ！　約束です♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生也不能\n把视线从我身上移开哦！说好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
